#: index
msgid "Swajp – Anax Keyboard for Android"
msgstr "Swajp – Keyboard Anax untuk Android"

#: index (atribut / attribute) languages (atribut / attribute) privacy (atribut / attribute) licenses (atribut / attribute)
msgid ""
"Swajp – swipe keyboard for Android, no internet access, offline dictation."
msgstr ""
"Swajp – keyboard geser untuk Android, tanpa akses internet, dikte offline."

#: index (atribut / attribute) languages (atribut / attribute) privacy (atribut / attribute) licenses (atribut / attribute)
msgid "Light / dark mode"
msgstr "Mode terang / gelap"

#: index languages privacy licenses
msgid "Home"
msgstr "Beranda"

#: index languages privacy licenses
msgid "Languages"
msgstr "Bahasa"

#: index languages privacy licenses
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr "Privasi"

#: index languages privacy licenses
msgid "Licenses"
msgstr "Lisensi"

#: index
msgid "Swajp – Anax Keyboard"
msgstr "Swajp – Keyboard Anax"

#: index
msgid "A keyboard<br><em>fit for an emperor.</em>"
msgstr "Keyboard<br><em>yang layak bagi kaisar.</em>"

#: index
msgid "Swift as Anax – the emperor dragonfly.<br>Precise as its hunt."
msgstr "Secepat Anax – sang capung kaisar.<br>Setepat caranya berburu."

#: index
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Inspired by Swype. Born as Swajp.</strong> An Android keyboard you type on with a glide of your finger. It guesses words from context, learns your style, and all your data stays on your phone."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Terinspirasi Swype. Lahir sebagai Swajp.</strong> Keyboard Android yang bisa kamu pakai mengetik cukup dengan menggeser jari. Ia menebak kata dari konteks, mempelajari gayamu, dan semua datamu tetap di ponsel."

#: index
msgid "Get it on Google Play"
msgstr "Temukan di Google Play"

#: index languages
msgid "Language packs"
msgstr "Paket bahasa"

#: index
msgid "Features"
msgstr "Fitur"

#: index
msgid "Swipe typing"
msgstr "Ketik geser"

#: index
msgid "Glide over the letters and the word appears."
msgstr "Geser jari di atas huruf, katanya langsung muncul."

#: index
msgid "Word prediction"
msgstr "Prediksi kata"

#: index
msgid "Suggests the next word from what you type."
msgstr "Menyarankan kata berikutnya dari apa yang kamu ketik."

#: index
msgid "Gestures & text editing"
msgstr "Gestur & edit teks"

#: index
msgid "Copy, paste, undo and select with one swipe."
msgstr "Salin, tempel, urungkan, dan pilih dengan sekali geser."

#: index
msgid "Emoji"
msgstr "Emoji"

#: index
msgid "Type a word and the emoji flies in."
msgstr "Ketik kata, emojinya langsung terbang datang."

#: index
msgid "Two languages at once, 35 in total."
msgstr "Dua bahasa sekaligus, total 35 bahasa."

#: index
msgid "Offline dictation"
msgstr "Dikte offline"

#: index
msgid "Speech to text right on your phone."
msgstr "Ucapan jadi teks langsung di ponselmu."

#: index
msgid "Clipboard history"
msgstr "Riwayat papan klip"

#: index
msgid "Your last 30 copied texts at hand."
msgstr "30 teks terakhir yang kamu salin selalu siap."

#: index
msgid "Number pad & calculator"
msgstr "Papan angka & kalkulator"

#: index
msgid "Big digits, a calculator and a scientific one."
msgstr "Angka besar, kalkulator, dan kalkulator ilmiah."

#: index
msgid "Backup"
msgstr "Cadangan"

#: index
msgid "Take your learned words to your new phone."
msgstr "Bawa kata-kata yang sudah dipelajari ke ponsel barumu."

#: index
msgid "No internet, no ads, no tracking."
msgstr "Tanpa internet, tanpa iklan, tanpa pelacakan."

#: index
msgid "Glide over the keys like a dragonfly."
msgstr "Meluncur di atas tombol bagai capung."

#: index (atribut / attribute)
msgid "Previous"
msgstr "Sebelumnya"

#: index (atribut / attribute)
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Berikutnya"

#: index
msgid ""
"No need to tap letter by letter – one stroke across the letters of a word is enough. Swajp recognises the swipe even when it is not perfect, and learns your style so it keeps getting more accurate."
msgstr ""
"Tak perlu mengetuk huruf demi huruf – cukup satu gerakan melewati huruf-huruf sebuah kata. Swajp mengenali geseranmu meski tidak sempurna, dan mempelajari gayamu sehingga makin lama makin akurat."

#: index
msgid "Predicts your next word like a dragonfly predicts its prey."
msgstr "Menebak kata berikutnya seperti capung menebak gerak mangsanya."

#: index
msgid ""
"From the words before, it suggests what you are likely to type next, and uses context to tell similar words apart. It learns the words you actually use."
msgstr ""
"Dari kata-kata sebelumnya, Swajp menyarankan apa yang mungkin kamu ketik berikutnya, dan memakai konteks untuk membedakan kata-kata yang mirip. Ia mempelajari kata-kata yang benar-benar kamu pakai."

#: index
msgid "Rules the air. Now rules your text."
msgstr "Menguasai udara. Kini menguasai teksmu."

#: index
msgid ""
"It flies backwards and forwards too – undo and redo, up to 60 steps. Moving the cursor to select or delete text is as precise as landing on a reed. Copy, paste, cut and select all with a swipe from the Swajp key, change case with a single gesture."
msgstr ""
"Ia juga bisa terbang mundur dan maju – urungkan dan ulangi, hingga 60 langkah. Menggeser kursor untuk memilih atau menghapus teks setepat capung mendarat di sebatang ilalang. Salin, tempel, potong, dan pilih semua dengan geseran dari tombol Swajp, ubah huruf besar/kecil dengan satu gestur."

#: index
msgid ""
"All gestures with demos and practice are in the app: Settings → Gestures and guide."
msgstr ""
"Semua gestur beserta demo dan latihannya ada di aplikasi: Setelan → Gestur dan panduan."

#: index
msgid "Catch your emotion mid-air."
msgstr "Tangkap emosimu di udara."

#: index
msgid ""
"Swipe or type a word – like “heart”, “beer” or “sad” – and Swajp offers the emoji in the suggestion bar. The :) shortcut works too, or simply pick one from the list."
msgstr ""
"Geser atau ketik sebuah kata – misalnya “hati”, “bir”, atau “sedih” – dan Swajp menawarkan emojinya di bilah saran. Pintasan :) juga bisa, atau pilih saja dari daftar."

#: index
msgid "Born to rule – in 35 languages."
msgstr "Terlahir untuk berkuasa – dalam 35 bahasa."

#: index
msgid ""
"Type in two languages without switching – the keyboard knows words from both. 9 languages are built in (English in two variants), 26 more can be downloaded as packs."
msgstr ""
"Ketik dalam dua bahasa tanpa berganti-ganti – keyboard mengenali kata dari keduanya. 9 bahasa sudah tersedia di aplikasi (bahasa Inggris dalam dua varian), 26 lainnya bisa diunduh sebagai paket."

#: index
msgid ""
"<span style=\"color:var(--g)\">Green</span> languages are built in, the others can be <a href=\"languages.html\">downloaded as packs</a>."
msgstr ""
"Bahasa bertanda <span style=\"color:var(--g)\">hijau</span> sudah tersedia di aplikasi, sisanya bisa <a href=\"languages.html\">diunduh sebagai paket</a>."

#: index
msgid "Hears you. Tells no one."
msgstr "Mendengarmu. Tak bercerita pada siapa pun."

#: index
msgid ""
"Speech is turned into text right on your phone (Parakeet and Omnilingual models), with no internet. If you like, you can use Google recognition instead. Recognised words are checked against the dictionary."
msgstr ""
"Ucapan diubah menjadi teks langsung di ponselmu (model Parakeet dan Omnilingual), tanpa internet. Jika mau, kamu juga bisa memakai pengenalan Google. Kata yang dikenali dicocokkan dengan kamus."

#: index
msgid "Remembers your copies. Forgets your secrets."
msgstr "Mengingat salinanmu. Melupakan rahasiamu."

#: index
msgid ""
"Your last 30 copied texts are always at hand. Passwords, codes and text marked as sensitive are never stored, and the history clears itself after the time you choose."
msgstr ""
"30 teks terakhir yang kamu salin selalu siap dipakai. Kata sandi, kode, dan teks yang ditandai sensitif tidak pernah disimpan, dan riwayat terhapus sendiri setelah waktu yang kamu pilih."

#: index
msgid "Even sharp minds reach for a calculator."
msgstr "Otak encer pun butuh kalkulator."

#: index
msgid ""
"Big digits for quick entry of phone numbers and amounts. A calculator and a scientific calculator right in the keyboard – no switching apps."
msgstr ""
"Angka besar untuk mengetik nomor telepon dan nominal dengan cepat. Kalkulator dan kalkulator ilmiah langsung di keyboard – tanpa berpindah aplikasi."

#: index
msgid ""
"A dragonfly can cross the sea. Your learned words and typing style can cross to your new phone."
msgstr ""
"Capung sanggup menyeberangi lautan. Kata-kata yang sudah dipelajari dan gaya mengetikmu pun bisa menyeberang ke ponsel barumu."

#: index
msgid ""
"Settings, your own words and everything Swajp has learned from your typing go into a single file – load it on your new phone and Swajp types like yours right away. The file stays with you: nothing goes over the internet or to the cloud."
msgstr ""
"Setelan, kata-katamu sendiri, dan semua yang dipelajari Swajp dari ketikanmu masuk ke satu file – muat di ponsel barumu dan Swajp langsung mengetik seperti milikmu yang lama. File itu tetap bersamamu: tidak ada yang lewat internet atau ke cloud."

#: index
msgid "You’re the hunter, never the prey."
msgstr "Kamu pemburunya, bukan mangsanya."

#: index
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Zero tracking, maximum privacy. </strong>Swajp has no internet permission. Nothing you type or dictate offline can leave your phone. No ads, no analytics. Nothing is learned or stored in password fields."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Tanpa pelacakan, privasi maksimal. </strong>Swajp tidak punya izin internet. Apa pun yang kamu ketik atau diktekan secara offline tidak bisa keluar dari ponselmu. Tanpa iklan, tanpa analitik. Di kolom kata sandi tidak ada yang dipelajari atau disimpan."

#: index
msgid "Privacy policy →"
msgstr "Kebijakan privasi →"

#: index
msgid ""
"<span class=\"o1\">They say when a dragonfly lands on you, change is coming into your life.</span>Let this one land on your fingertips."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"o1\">Konon, jika capung hinggap padamu, perubahan akan datang dalam hidupmu.</span>Biarkan yang satu ini hinggap di ujung jarimu."

#: languages
msgid "Swajp – language packs"
msgstr "Swajp – paket bahasa"

#: languages
msgid ""
"Languages that are not built into the app can be added as a pack. It is a plain zip with a dictionary – nothing gets installed and the app needs no internet for it."
msgstr ""
"Bahasa yang tidak tersedia di aplikasi bisa ditambahkan sebagai paket. Paket itu hanya file zip berisi kamus – tidak ada yang diinstal dan aplikasi tidak butuh internet untuk itu."

#: languages
msgid "How to add a pack"
msgstr "Cara menambahkan paket"

#: languages
msgid ""
"Download the zip of the language you want. It is saved to your Downloads folder."
msgstr "Unduh zip bahasa yang kamu inginkan. File disimpan di folder Unduhan."

#: languages
msgid "Open <b>Swajp → Settings → Languages → More languages (packs)</b>."
msgstr "Buka <b>Swajp → Setelan → Bahasa → Bahasa lainnya (paket)</b>."

#: languages
msgid ""
"Tap <b>Import language packs (one or more)</b> and choose the downloaded file."
msgstr ""
"Ketuk <b>Impor paket bahasa (satu atau lebih)</b> lalu pilih file yang diunduh."

#: languages
msgid "Select the new language as your main or second language."
msgstr "Pilih bahasa baru sebagai bahasa utama atau kedua."

